<%#
  Sportart identifier: a monogram chip (the Sportart's initial in the display
  serif) tinted with that sport's own soft hue (one hue per sport, kept light
  so it stays clear of the green/gray/red status badges).

  Locals:
    sportart: the Sportart name (string)
%>
<span class="sport-chip <%= sportart_palette(sportart)[:chip] %>" title="<%= sportart %>"><span class="sr-only"><%= sportart %></span><span aria-hidden="true"><%= sportart.to_s.first&.upcase %></span></span>
